+# mlx-omarchy: the decode loops below read the sampled token's logprob off
+# the device for every token (a gather graph plus a blocking read) even when
+# no consumer wants it: Response.logprob is read only when the request sets
+# logprobs, Response.top_tokens only when top_logprobs > 0. When neither is
+# requested the read is skipped and the Response carries logprob=None and
+# top_tokens=None; generated tokens are unchanged. MLX_OMARCHY_SERVER_LOGPROB_READ=1
+# restores the unconditional upstream read (read once at import).
